4-602.13 General cleaning of all surfaces throughout the facility is needed due to a currently activity roach population.
Specific areas in need of detail cleaning include the following: 
1. Soda machine motor compartment beneath the ice bin (moisture/debris and roach egg cases);
2. Fan/motor compartment of the grill cooler (grease/food debris accumulation);
3. Drip tray at stove top (old splash/food debris);
4. Drip pans for grills (grease/food debris); 
5. Underneath stove and grills (food debris); and
6. General surfaces of grill cooler, especially along the back by the wall (grease). 
Nonfood contact surfaces shall be cleaned at a frequency necessary to eliminate buildup of grease, food splash and general debris.
